  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> be the origin and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is a right angled isosceles triangle with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;as hypotenuse, then which of the following is NOT true?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
