  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> be the origin and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,</p><p>Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is a right angled isosceles triangle with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;as hypotenuse,</p><p>Plotting the diagram we get,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0084_b5e870fb2dda.png\" style=\"width: 284px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now by using concept of rotation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;is not true.</p></blockquote>"
  }
